							conditionLua = "-- [Tank Mit] (2026-11-22): the Warrior reactions copied from Warrior MT test run only for a Warrior with the option on.\nlocal t = data.topTankMit\nreturn Player ~= nil and Player.job == 21 and t ~= nil and t.on == true",
